      "statement": "---\\nid: OPP-001-01\\nopportunity_id: OPP-001\\ncheckpoint: OPP-001-01\\nindustry: Healthcare / Hospital Operations\\ncompany: Apollo Hospitals Enterprise Limited\\ncompany_role: Reference Workflow / Capability Benchmark\\ngeography: India\\nworkflow: Cashless Pre-Authorisation\\nworkflow_archetype: Hospital Insurance / TPA Pre-Authorisation\\nresearch_type: Legacy VRL Methodology\\nresearch_stage: Workflow Discovery\\nstatus: PASS\\ndecision: AOI\\nevidence_posture: Evidence-first\\nsource_standard: Official company and institutional sources\\nail_status: Ready for compilation\\nconfidence: High\\n---",
