      "statement": "---\\nid: OPP-016-01\\nopportunity_id: OPP-016\\nindustry: Healthcare / Hospital Operations\\ncompany: Nayati Medicity, Mathura\\nlocation: Mathura, Uttar Pradesh, India\\nworkflow: Urgent Inpatient Red Blood Cell Transfusion — Order → Sample → Blood Bank → Issue → Transfusion\\npain_type: Life-Saving Procedure / Time-Critical Logistics / Cross-Department Coordination\\nresearch_stage: Workflow Discovery\\nmethodology: Legacy VRL\\nstatus: PASS\\ndecision: HIGH-CONSEQUENCE_TIME-CRITICAL_WORKFLOW_TARGET\\ncompany_pain_signal: direct_hospital_study_evidence\\ncurrent_pain_magnitude: directly_measured_historical\\ncurrent_capability_gap: unknown\\ncustomer_roi: unknown\\ncommercial_status: discovery_continue\\n---",
