      "statement": "## II-008 — Hybrid Rule + AI Automation\\n\\nBMC demonstrates coexistence of:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nRULES\\n+\\nPOLICIES\\n+\\nAI\\n+\\nTOOLS\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nSources:\\n\\nhttps://docs.bmc.com/xwiki/bin/view/Mainframe/Ops/BMC-AMI-Ops-Automation/bao8301/Getting-started-with-BMC-AMI-Ops-Automation/Product-features-and-key-concepts-of-BMC-AMI-Ops-Automation/Basic-automation/\\n\\nhttps://docs.bmc.com/xwiki/bin/view/Mainframe/Ops/MainView-Middleware-Monitor/MVMM92/Getting-started/User-goals-and-features/",
