      "statement": "# 22. II-009 — Tool Registry as Execution Infrastructure\\n\\nBMC's MCP gateway centralizes:\\n\\n- server registration;\\n- tools;\\n- prompts;\\n- namespaces;\\n- authentication;\\n- authorization;\\n- connection testing.\\n\\nSource:\\n\\nhttps://docs.bmc.com/xwiki/bin/view/Mainframe/Common/BMC-AMI-Platform/amip23/Using/Using-Platform-Manager/MCP-gateway/",
