      "statement": "# 24. II-011 — Namespace-Based Capability Governance\\n\\nBMC assigns tools to namespaces and creates namespace-specific roles.\\n\\nSource:\\n\\nhttps://docs.bmc.com/xwiki/bin/view/Mainframe/Common/BMC-AMI-Platform/amip23/Using/Using-Platform-Manager/MCP-gateway/",
