      "id": "EV-BMC-001-056",
      "statement": "# 25. Native Capability Boundary\\n\\nThe strongest documented BMC model is:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCONDITIONS\\n ↓\\nPOLICY MATCH\\n ↓\\nAVAILABLE AUTOMATION\\n ↓\\nMANUAL / AUTOMATIC\\n ↓\\nEXECUTE\\n ↓\\nSTATUS\\n ↓\\nRESOLUTION\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nplus:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nAI\\n ↓\\nRECOMMENDATION\\n ↓\\nHUMAN REVIEW\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nand:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nWORKLOAD\\n ↓\\nCONSTRAINTS\\n ↓\\nPOLICY\\n ↓\\nRESOURCE / ROUTING ACTION\\n\`\`\`",
