      "id": "EV-BMC-001-072",
      "statement": "## Evidence\\n\\nBMC's current Control-M AI documentation describes:\\n\\n- AI Workflow Creator;\\n- Control-M AI Pilot for Planning.\\n\\nAI Workflow Creator can create workflows consisting of folders, subfolders and jobs from natural-language prompts.\\n\\nAI Pilot for Planning can create/configure jobs and folders in an existing workspace and suggest job descriptions or modify schedules based on user requests.",
      "classification": "SOURCE_EVIDENCE",
