      "id": "IN-BMC-001-075",
      "statement": "# 6. Test 3 — Can BMC Execute Conditional Actions?\\n\\nYes.\\n\\nControl-M job properties support conditional actions including:\\n\\n- rerun;\\n- set status;\\n- stop cyclic run;\\n- run;\\n- notify;\\n- remedy;\\n- event addition/deletion;\\n- output actions.\\n\\nThese can be triggered by If conditions.\\n\\nBMC therefore already has:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCONDITION\\n ↓\\nACTION\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nand:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nFAILURE / EVENT\\n ↓\\nREMEDY / RERUN / OTHER ACTION\\n\`\`\`",
