      "statement": "# 30. OPP-01-01 Opportunity Strength\\n\\n| Dimension | Assessment |\\n|---|---|\\n| State-dependent automation | 🟢 Strong native |\\n| State transitions | 🟢 Strong native |\\n| Error/timeout handling | 🟢 Strong native |\\n| Failover automation | 🟢 Strong native |\\n| Dynamic resource optimization | 🟢 Native in specific domain |\\n| Policy lifecycle control | 🟢 Native |\\n| Multi-option remediation | 🟢 Multiple policies/options |\\n| Runtime option generation | 🟡 Unknown |\\n| Multi-objective action arbitration | 🟡 Unknown |\\n| Cross-system consequence optimization | 🟡 Unknown |\\n| Continuous generalized replanning | 🟡 Unknown |\\n| ART advantage | 🔴 Not demonstrated |\\n| Customer pain | 🔴 Not established |\\n| Commercial value | 🔴 Not established |\\n| AIL | 🔴 Not ready |\\n\\n---",
