      "statement": "# 26. What Remains Valuable\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nBMC\\n│\\n├── Opportunity 01\\n│     └── KILLED\\n│\\n└── Implementation Intelligence\\n      ├── AI planning\\n      ├── AI configuration\\n      ├── MCP\\n      ├── policy automation\\n      ├── state machines\\n      ├── conditional recovery\\n      ├── human validation\\n      ├── optimization\\n      ├── tool governance\\n      ├── workflow generation\\n      └── execution verification\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThis is exactly why the dual-track research model is valuable.\\n\\nA killed opportunity can still produce **high-value ART intelligence**.\\n\\n---",
