      "statement": "# 6. Evidence of Approval-Driven Workflow\\n\\nBMC documentation across its products demonstrates approval-aware workflows.\\n\\nFor example, BMC AMI Security Privileged Access Manager documentation describes workflows where processing can pause until approval is received, after which the workflow continues automatically.\\n\\nThis is not necessarily BMC Helix ITSM service-request behavior, so it must not be treated as direct proof of an identical Helix workflow.\\n\\nIt is useful as **BMC implementation intelligence**:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREQUEST\\n ↓\\nPOLICY\\n ↓\\nAPPROVAL REQUIRED\\n ↓\\nPAUSE\\n ↓\\nAPPROVAL\\n ↓\\nCONTINUE AUTOMATICALLY\\n\`\`\`",
