      "id": "EV-BMC-002-019",
      "statement": "# 7. Dependency State Is Already a Recovery Criterion\\n\\nThe restart restriction for parent services with child services still in progress is direct evidence that dependency state affects recovery eligibility.\\n\\nThe underlying pattern is:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nPARENT FAILURE\\n +\\nCHILD STILL RUNNING\\n       ↓\\nDO NOT RESTART\\n\`\`\`",
