      "id": "EV-BMC-002-020",
      "statement": "# 9. Workflow Type Is Already a Recovery Criterion\\n\\nRestart behavior differs according to how the request/process was created.\\n\\nBMC explicitly excludes certain BMC Helix Business Workflows cases from the restart operation.\\n\\nThus:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREQUEST TYPE\\n ↓\\nRECOVERY ELIGIBILITY\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nis native.",
