      "id": "IN-BMC-002-012",
      "statement": "# 13. BMC Also Handles Request Eligibility\\n\\nBMC service requests use entitlement rules that determine which services customers are allowed to see based on criteria such as company or group membership. Rules can also determine who may submit requests on behalf of others.\\n\\nTherefore a service request can be constrained before fulfillment:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREQUEST\\n ↓\\nENTITLEMENT\\n ↓\\nELIGIBLE?\\n ↓\\nFULFILLMENT\\n\`\`\`",
