      "id": "IN-BMC-002-028",
      "statement": "# 5. BMC Already Uses Diagnosis Before Recovery\\n\\nBMC documents a concrete scenario where a service-request status update fails because a required field is missing.\\n\\nThe documented sequence is:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nERROR\\n ↓\\nVIEW ERROR DETAILS\\n ↓\\nIDENTIFY MISSING FIELD\\n ↓\\nCORRECT CASE\\n ↓\\nREPROCESS\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe example identifies a missing Effective Date as the cause.\\n\\nThis means BMC already distinguishes:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nTRANSIENT / PROCESSABLE ERROR\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nfrom:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nDATA / BUSINESS CONDITION ERROR\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nat least in documented application-error workflows.",
