      "id": "IN-BMC-002-045",
      "statement": "# 30. Strategic Decision\\n\\nAt this point, OPP-02 is approaching the same danger that caused the earlier ServiceNow opportunities to become unproductive.\\n\\nWe have a technically interesting residual:\\n\\n> **dynamic recovery arbitration**\\n\\nbut we do not yet have evidence of a sufficiently strong business problem.\\n\\nTherefore we should **not** continue indefinitely with:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nOPP-02-05\\nOPP-02-06\\nOPP-02-07\\n...\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nunless the next checkpoint produces actual evidence of decision burden.\\n\\n---",
