      "statement": "## Source Register\\n\\n- **Integrating Control-M Workload Change Manager & BMC Helix ITSM** — real large-bank case, hundreds of job-scheduling changes daily, manual change creation/status checking and integrated automation.\\n- **Assessing the risk for a change request** — risk criteria, ML-based operational metrics, impacted parameters and historical incident trends.\\n- **AI-suggested change risk** — AI-supported approve/hold/reject decision context.\\n- **Detecting collisions between change requests** — automatic collision detection, interpretation, collaboration, business justification and audit trail.\\n- **Approving change requests** — review of schedule, budget, impact and risk; approve/reject/hold.\\n- **Submitting change requests through approval phases** — configurable approval requirements and governance.\\n- **Learning about Change Management** — impact analysis, collision detection, scheduling and availability.\\n\\n---",
