      "statement": "# Source Register\\n\\n- **Detecting collisions between change requests** — collision definition, time/CI factors, direct/indirect effects, human interpretation, statuses, rationale, audit trail and documented VM/server example.\\n- **Learning about Change Management** — coordinator workflow, collision resolution, forward scheduling and risk/impact review.\\n- **Detecting conflicts by using the Calendar** — collision display, coordinator contact, rescheduling and iterative collision checking.\\n- **Performing changes that require approval** — real change-coordinator scheduling workflow and Collision Detection/Schedule Assist.\\n- **Managing change request collisions** — collision visibility and coordinator communication.\\n\\n---",
      "classification": "DIRECT_EVIDENCE",
