      "statement": "# 19. Strong counterevidence — BMC supports auditability\\n\\nBMC stores collision status and rationale and provides a collision-status audit trail with timestamp, user, status and reason.\\n\\nART therefore needs to preserve at least:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nRECOMMENDATION\\n+\\nEVIDENCE\\n+\\nRATIONALE\\n+\\nDECISION OWNER\\n+\\nOUTCOME\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nif it ever participates in this workflow.\\n\\n---",
