      "statement": "# 17. But human judgment is not automatically an opportunity\\n\\nWe still need:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREPEATED\\n+\\nTIME-CONSUMING\\n+\\nCOSTLY\\n+\\nRISKY\\n+\\nINCONSISTENT\\n+\\nMEASURABLE\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe bank case establishes high-volume **administrative change processing**, but it does not quantify the residual burden of:\\n\\n- collision interpretation;\\n- rescheduling;\\n- risk arbitration;\\n- approval judgment.\\n\\nTherefore we cannot yet claim the residual decision is commercially important.\\n\\n---",
