      "id": "IN-BMC-003-006",
      "statement": "## \`OPP-03-03.md — Real Change-Collision Decision Reconstruction\`\\n\\nThe next checkpoint should reconstruct **one concrete collision decision**:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCHANGE A\\n+\\nCHANGE B\\n ↓\\nSAME CI / OVERLAPPING WINDOW\\n ↓\\nCOLLISION\\n ↓\\nWHAT MUST THE HUMAN DETERMINE?\\n ↓\\nIGNORE?\\nRESCHEDULE A?\\nRESCHEDULE B?\\nBLOCK?\\nCOORDINATE?\\nESCALATE?\\n ↓\\nWHAT EVIDENCE IS USED?\\n ↓\\nHOW LONG DOES IT TAKE?\\n ↓\\nWHAT IS THE BUSINESS COST?\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe objective is to find evidence of the **residual decision burden**, not another list of BMC features.\\n\\nIf the burden is not demonstrable, kill OPP-03.\\n\\nIf it is demonstrable, then test whether ART can improve the decision materially.\\n\\n---",
