      "implication": "# 4. What information does the human receive?\\n\\nBMC's Collision Detection dialog can expose:\\n\\n- Change ID;\\n- summary;\\n- CI name;\\n- status;\\n- change coordinator;\\n- scheduled start/end dates;\\n- conflicting change ID;\\n- conflicting scheduled dates.\\n\\nUsers can also inspect the change coordinator profile and contact conflicting coordinators.\\n\\nThis means the human decision is not made from a binary alert alone.\\n\\nThe decision context is approximately:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCURRENT CHANGE\\n+\\nCONFLICTING CHANGE\\n+\\nCI\\n+\\nSTATUS\\n+\\nTIMING\\n+\\nOWNERSHIP\\n\`\`\`",
