      "id": "IN-BMC-003-010",
      "statement": "## B. CI factor\\n\\nPossible relationships include:\\n\\n- direct effect on the same CI;\\n- indirect effect through dependent CIs.\\n\\nThe latter means a change may collide even when the two requests are not directly attached to exactly the same CI.\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCOLLISION RISK\\n=\\nTIME RELATIONSHIP\\n+\\nCI / DEPENDENCY RELATIONSHIP\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n---",
