      "investigation_question": "OPP-04-01 changed the research objective from:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nFIND A GAP IN BMC\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nto:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nUNDERSTAND HOW BMC DESIGNS ENTERPRISE WORKFLOWS\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThis checkpoint therefore reconstructs the BMC Sample Finance **Received Invoice** workflow at the deepest level supported by public evidence.\\n\\nThe central question is:\\n\\n> **What exactly happens between an invoice being received and payment being made, what does BMC automate, what remains human work, what decisions are represented, and which implementation patterns can ART reuse?**\\n\\n---",
