      "statement": "## 9. External applications can create and update workflow records\\n\\nBMC documents API/interface processes that allow external applications to:\\n\\n- create cases;\\n- update cases;\\n- create external tasks;\\n- update external tasks.\\n\\n\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nEXTERNAL SYSTEM\\n ↓\\nCREATE / UPDATE\\n ↓\\nBMC CASE / TASK\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nis a supported pattern.\\n\\nThis matters for Finance because an external finance system could theoretically initiate or update workflow work.",
