      "statement": "# 15. Intelligence Layer 12 — Integration is part of workflow execution\\n\\nBMC Helix Business Workflows integrates with BMC products and third-party applications. BMC Helix Integration Service uses connectors to establish flows between applications.\\n\\nThe generic pattern is:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nWORKFLOW EVENT\\n      ↓\\nINTEGRATION FLOW\\n      ↓\\nEXTERNAL ACTION\\n      ↓\\nRESULT\\n      ↓\\nWORKFLOW CONTINUES\\n\`\`\`",
