      "id": "IN-BMC-004-005",
      "statement": "# 10. BMC's broader workflow architecture provides useful strategy intelligence\\n\\nBMC's Business Workflows architecture allows a line of business to have its own:\\n\\n- definitions;\\n- roles;\\n- data-access permissions;\\n- templates;\\n- tasks;\\n- knowledge;\\n- assignments;\\n- approvals;\\n- service-level targets.\\n\\n\\n\\nThis indicates a reusable implementation pattern:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nGLOBAL PLATFORM\\n      ↓\\nLINE OF BUSINESS\\n      ↓\\nBUSINESS-SPECIFIC CONFIGURATION\\n      ↓\\nCASE TEMPLATE\\n      ↓\\nTASK FLOW\\n      ↓\\nAUTOMATION\\n      ↓\\nHUMAN DECISION\\n      ↓\\nOUTCOME\\n\`\`\`",
