      "id": "IN-BMC-004-014",
      "statement": "# 6. Task 1 decision surface\\n\\nEven though BMC does not publish the detailed review criteria, the workflow structure implies that the review task is a gate between:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nINVOICE RECEIVED\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nand:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nVOUCHER CREATION\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe safe representation is therefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nINVOICE\\n   ↓\\nREVIEW\\n   ↓\\n[OUTCOME DETERMINES WHETHER NEXT TASK CAN PROCEED]\\n   ↓\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe exact outcomes are not publicly documented in the source reviewed.\\n\\nDo not invent:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nAPPROVED\\nREJECTED\\nRETURNED\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nunless additional BMC evidence establishes those states for this template.\\n\\n---",
