      "id": "IN-BMC-004-018",
      "statement": "# 12. Workflow implementation pattern\\n\\nBMC instructs case business analysts to:\\n\\n1. copy the case and task templates;\\n2. update the Company and associated processes;\\n3. review and update the task-flow process;\\n4. create organization-specific notification templates when required;\\n5. save the customized template;\\n6. grant the appropriate line-of-business functional role where applicable;\\n7. test the content in QA before production deployment.\\n\\n\\n\\nThis gives us a concrete implementation strategy:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREFERENCE TEMPLATE\\n        ↓\\nCOPY\\n        ↓\\nCUSTOMIZE COMPANY / PROCESS\\n        ↓\\nCUSTOMIZE TASK FLOW\\n        ↓\\nCUSTOMIZE NOTIFICATIONS\\n        ↓\\nQA\\n        ↓\\nPRODUCTION\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n---",
