      "id": "IN-BMC-004-037",
      "statement": "# 8. Approver selection can itself be rule-driven\\n\\nBMC's approval-flow configuration allows conditions to qualify approvers.\\n\\nFor a general approval flow, the administrator can:\\n\\n- define a qualification expression;\\n- select approvers;\\n- define a qualification expression for approvers;\\n- determine what happens when multiple approvers are involved.\\n\\n\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCASE / TASK\\n      ↓\\nQUALIFICATION\\n      ↓\\nAPPROVAL FLOW\\n      ↓\\nQUALIFY APPROVER\\n      ↓\\nAPPROVER(S)\\n\`\`\`",
