      "id": "IN-BMC-004-042",
      "statement": "# 16. Rejection is a state transition, not merely a message\\n\\nBMC documents that when a task is rejected, it can move to:\\n\\n- the previous status; or\\n- a Rejected status.\\n\\nWhen approved, it moves to the next status.\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nAPPROVAL\\n ├─ APPROVE → NEXT STATE\\n └─ REJECT  → PREVIOUS / REJECTED STATE\\n\`\`\`",
