      "id": "IN-BMC-004-051",
      "statement": "# 23. New ART intelligence: decision-owner computation\\n\\nBMC's approval flow can determine approvers through qualification conditions.\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nWORK ITEM\\n ↓\\nCONTEXT\\n ↓\\nWHO SHOULD DECIDE?\\n ↓\\nAPPROVER\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe decision owner itself can be dynamically selected.\\n\\nThis should become a first-class field in ART workflow representations:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nDECISION_OWNER_RULE\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nrather than merely:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nOWNER = Finance Manager\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n---",
