      "id": "IN-BMC-004-059",
      "statement": "# 9. Exception path F — multi-approver quorum\\n\\nBMC's General Approval Flow supports multiple approvers and can specify whether:\\n\\n- all approvers must approve;\\n- one approver is sufficient;\\n- N% of approvers must approve.\\n\\n\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nN APPROVERS\\n      ↓\\nQUORUM RULE\\n ┌────┼────┐\\nALL  ONE   N%\\n      ↓\\nOUTCOME\\n\`\`\`",
      "basis": [
        "EV-BMC-004-026",
        "EV-BMC-004-027",
        "EV-BMC-004-028"
      ],
      "implication": "# 9. Exception path F — multi-approver quorum\\n\\nBMC's General Approval Flow supports multiple approvers and can specify whether:\\n\\n- all approvers must approve;\\n- one approver is sufficient;\\n- N% of approvers must approve.\\n\\n\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nN APPROVERS\\n      ↓\\nQUORUM RULE\\n ┌────┼────┐\\nALL  ONE   N%\\n      ↓\\nOUTCOME\\n\`\`\`",
