      "id": "IN-BMC-004-067",
      "statement": "# 16. Reconstructing the possible invoice exception architecture\\n\\nWe still cannot claim that the BMC **Received Invoice** template actually uses all these branches.\\n\\nWhat we can safely construct is the **BMC-compatible architecture**:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nRECEIVED INVOICE\\n      ↓\\nREVIEW INVOICE\\n      ↓\\nAPPROVAL TRIGGER?\\n      ↓\\n┌───────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                                       │\\n│ SELF-APPROVAL                         │\\n│   ↓                                   │\\n│ QUALIFICATION                         │\\n│   ├─ MATCH → AUTO-APPROVE             │\\n│   └─ NO MATCH → APPROVAL FLOW CHECK   │\\n│                                       │\\n│ APPROVAL FLOW                         │\\n│   ↓                                   │\\n│ APPROVER(S)                           │\\n│   ├─ APPROVE → NEXT STATE             │\\n│   └─ REJECT → RECOVERY / REJECTED     │\\n│                                       │\\n│ NO APPROVAL FOUND → FALLBACK STATE    │\\n│                                       │\\n│ ERROR → ERROR / RECOVERY STATE        │\\n└───────────────────────────────────────┘\\n      ↓\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n      ↓\\nMAKE PAYMENT\\n\`\`\`",
