      "id": "IN-BMC-004-082",
      "statement": "# \`OPP-04-05.md — Invoice Automation and Integration Strategy Reconstruction\`\\n\\nThe next checkpoint should investigate:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREVIEW INVOICE\\n      ↓\\nAUTOMATED?\\n      ↓\\nWHAT SYSTEMS?\\n      ↓\\nWHAT DATA?\\n      ↓\\nWHAT PROCESS?\\n      ↓\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n      ↓\\nAUTOMATED?\\n      ↓\\nWHAT INTEGRATION?\\n      ↓\\nMAKE PAYMENT\\n      ↓\\nAUTOMATED?\\n      ↓\\nWHAT EXTERNAL SYSTEM?\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nPriority evidence:\\n\\n1. BMC official workflow documentation;\\n2. BMC Innovation Studio process documentation;\\n3. BMC Finance implementation examples;\\n4. BMC partner implementation material;\\n5. BMC customer case studies;\\n6. official BMC API/integration documentation where it describes the workflow.\\n\\nThe goal is to discover **how enterprise workflow automation is actually wired to external systems**, not just how decisions are governed.\\n\\n---",
