      "statement": "## 4. Integration is flow-driven\\n\\nBMC states that a case business analyst can design a flow that defines:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nTRIGGER\\n ↓\\nACTION\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nthrough connectors.\\n\\nThe documented integration process includes:\\n\\n1. configure the connector;\\n2. design the flow;\\n3. define triggers;\\n4. perform actions in Business Workflows or the external application.\\n\\n\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nEVENT\\n ↓\\nINTEGRATION FLOW\\n ↓\\nEXTERNAL ACTION\\n ↓\\nRESULT\\n ↓\\nWORKFLOW CONTINUES\\n\`\`\`",
