      "id": "IN-BMC-004-088",
      "statement": "## 10. Attachments are integration data\\n\\nBMC's Business Workflows connector can add attachments from an external application to a case or task.\\n\\nBMC documents support for attachments up to 5 MB through the connector and describes how multiple attachment actions can be configured.\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nEXTERNAL DOCUMENT\\n ↓\\nINTEGRATION\\n ↓\\nCASE / TASK ATTACHMENT\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nis part of the workflow architecture.",
