      "id": "IN-BMC-004-092",
      "statement": "## 18. What this means for Received Invoice\\n\\nThe documented invoice workflow is:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREVIEW INVOICE\\n ↓\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n ↓\\nMAKE PAYMENT\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe platform can support architectures such as:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nREVIEW INVOICE\\n ↓\\nPROCESS / RULE\\n ↓\\nEXTERNAL API\\n ↓\\nACCOUNTING SYSTEM\\n ↓\\nRETURN RESULT\\n ↓\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nor:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nCREATE VOUCHER\\n ↓\\nCONNECTOR\\n ↓\\nEXTERNAL FINANCE SYSTEM\\n ↓\\nRESULT\\n ↓\\nMAKE PAYMENT\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nBut these are **architecture hypotheses**, not evidence that BMC configured them in the Sample Finance template.\\n\\n---",
