      "id": "IN-BMC-004-102",
      "statement": "# 9. Intelligence Layer 6 — Approval routing is itself a decision\\n\\nBMC allows approval flows to be selected through qualification expressions.\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\n\`\`\`text\\nWORK ITEM\\n ↓\\nCONTEXT\\n ↓\\nWHICH APPROVAL FLOW?\\n ↓\\nWHO SHOULD DECIDE?\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe decision owner can therefore be derived from context rather than simply hard-coded.",
