      "title": "OPP-006-04 — Context-Dependent Policy Selection Reconstruction",
      "status": "POLICY-SHIFT PATTERN VERIFIED — SERVICE NOW GAP NOT ESTABLISHED",
      "investigation_question": "## Company\\nServiceNow\\n## Opportunity\\nOPP-006\\n## Checkpoint\\nOPP-006-04\\n## Investigation Type\\n**Context-dependent policy selection reconstruction**\\n## Status",
      "tested": "**Context-dependent policy selection reconstruction**",
      "found": "OPP-006-03 narrowed the surviving hypothesis to:\\n> **When operating context changes materially, the scheduling policy itself may need to change. The unresolved question is who or what determines that policy shift.**\\nRequired chain:\\nNORMAL OPERATING CONTEXT\\n↓\\nMATERIAL CONTEXT CHANGE\\n↓\\nCURRENT POLICY BECOMES LESS SUITABLE\\n↓\\nALTERNATIVE POLICY EXISTS\\n↓\\nPOLICY SELECTION\\n↓\\nREOPTIMIZATION\\n↓\\nOUTCOME\\nThis checkpoint tests whether that pattern is real and whether ServiceNow has a meaningful residual gap at the policy-selection boundary.",
