  "primary_question": "Whether changing supplier, inventory, order, customer, recovery, and policy state creates a persistent decision-continuity gap between optimizer and workflow\\n\\nThe initial question was whether supplier-risk response contained a decision capability not covered by ServiceNow. The initial hypothesis was broad: supplier disruption might require decision intelligence. It evolved into dynamic continuity: a strategic recommendation may become stale as supplier capacity, customer priority, recovery time, or policy changes.",
