      "statement": "ServiceNow's current Supplier Relationship and Performance Management release notes describe a GenAI-powered supplier-performance summarization capability.\\nThe summary can include:\\n- supplier performance score and trend;\\n- narrative insight;\\n- failing KPIs;\\n- KPIs in action plans;\\n- KPIs approaching thresholds;\\n- historical context;\\n- recommended next steps.\\nSource:\\nhttps://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/store-release-notes/store-rn-source-to-pay-ops-supplier-relationship-perf-mgmt.html",
      "classification": "DIRECT EVIDENCE",
