      "id": "EV-007-018",
      "statement": "IBM reports using AI to monitor external disruption signals and act quickly to secure a second supply source.\\nSource:\\nhttps://www.ibm.com/case-studies/ibm-supply-chain\\nThe case describes:\\n- demand sensing;\\n- external disruption monitoring;\\n- risk management;\\n- rapid action to secure a second source;\\n- integrated information for employees to understand and mitigate disruptions.",
