      "statement": "Accenture describes a supply-chain resilience program using:\\n- supplier/component risk heat maps;\\n- a supply-chain digital twin;\\n- disruption stress testing;\\n- resiliency scoring;\\n- mitigation analysis.\\nThe program reportedly reduced revenue at risk by several hundred million dollars.\\nSource:\\nhttps://www.accenture.com/us-en/case-studies/supply-chain-operations/risk-management-supply-chain-resilience",
