      "statement": "A realistic enterprise architecture can be:\\nERP / APS / SUPPLY-CHAIN OPTIMIZER\\n↓\\nSTRATEGIC RECOMMENDATION\\n↓\\nSERVICE NOW\\n↓\\nWORKFLOW\\n↓\\nAPPROVAL\\n↓\\nSUPPLIER / PO EXECUTION\\nThis architecture would leave ServiceNow responsible for workflow and execution while a specialized planning/optimization platform handles mathematical optimization.",
