      "investigation_question": "## Company\\nServiceNow\\n## Opportunity\\nOPP-008\\n## Checkpoint\\nOPP-008-02\\n## Investigation Type\\n**Real patient-flow decision reconstruction**\\n## Status",
      "tested": "**Real patient-flow decision reconstruction**",
