      "title": "OPP-008-06 — Cross-System Decision-Synthesis Reconstruction",
      "status": "REFINE — CROSS-SYSTEM SYNTHESIS IS REAL; SERVICE NOW-SPECIFIC GAP REMAINS UNPROVEN",
      "investigation_question": "## Company\\nServiceNow\\n## Opportunity\\nOPP-008\\n## Checkpoint\\nOPP-008-06\\n## Investigation Type\\n**Cross-system decision-synthesis reconstruction**\\n## Status",
      "tested": "**Cross-system decision-synthesis reconstruction**",
      "found": "The surviving OPP-008 hypothesis is:\\n> **There may be a residual decision-synthesis problem at the boundary between multiple specialized hospital decision-support tools, where a command centre must reconcile conflicting signals and determine a system-level intervention.**\\nThis checkpoint asks:\\n> **Do real hospital command centres actually have to reconcile information from multiple systems and sources before making patient-flow decisions, and is that reconciliation materially difficult despite existing digital infrastructure?**\\nThis is the critical test before considering any specialized solution.",
