      "statement": "ServiceNow Demand Forecast provides staffing forecasts at 15-, 30-, and 60-minute intervals and allows managers to identify:\\n- understaffing;\\n- overstaffing;\\n- aligned staffing.\\nManagers can adjust staffing alignment according to forecast demand.\\nSource:\\nhttps://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/explore-demand-forecast-configurable-wfo-cs.html",
