      "statement": "The documented Care Team Operations agentic workflow is primarily an:\\nINTAKE\\n→\\nCLARIFICATION\\n→\\nCASE CREATION\\n→\\nROUTING\\n→\\nFULFILLMENT\\nworkflow.\\nThe documentation does not establish that this agent autonomously performs:\\nPATIENT-FLOW STATE MODELING\\n+\\nMULTI-RESOURCE OPTIMIZATION\\n+\\nSYSTEM-WIDE TRADE-OFF ANALYSIS\\n+\\nPREDICTIVE CAPACITY CONSEQUENCE\\nfor hospital patient flow.",
