  "primary_question": "Whether ServiceNow can natively preserve causal execution context across multiple workflows, agents, systems, and human decisions belonging to one business objective\\n\\nThe initial question was whether a real ServiceNow workflow could be identified in which normal agentic automation reaches an exception and brings a human into the loop, creating a live execution situation where ART could potentially add measurable value. The broad hypothesis was that ART can provide execution intelligence beyond ServiceNow's native capabilities.",
