      "title": "OPP-009-01 — Real Exception Workflow Discovery",
      "status": "SURVIVES — REAL EXCEPTION WORKFLOW IDENTIFIED; ART ADVANTAGE NOT YET ESTABLISHED",
      "investigation_question": "## Company\\nServiceNow\\n## Opportunity\\nOPP-009\\n## Checkpoint\\nOPP-009-01\\n## Status",
      "tested": "OPP-009-01 — Real Exception Workflow Discovery",
      "found": "## Company\\nServiceNow\\n## Opportunity\\nOPP-009\\n## Checkpoint\\nOPP-009-01\\n## Status\\n# SURVIVES — REAL EXCEPTION WORKFLOW IDENTIFIED; ART ADVANTAGE NOT YET ESTABLISHED\\n## 1. Research Question\\nCan we identify a real ServiceNow workflow in which normal agentic automation reaches an exception, brings a human into the loop, and creates a live execution situation where ART could potentially add measurable value?\\nThe investigation must begin from the strongest current ServiceNow baseline rather than from an assumed capability gap.\\n## 2. Workflow Selected — ServiceNow Intelligent Approvals",
